      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PRO",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Come, eat some of my bread, Drink some of the wine which I have mixed!",
      "ko": "너는 와서 내 식물을 먹으며 내 혼합한 포도주를 마시고",
      "source_text_hash": "cfbc36775dbb78608e585e63cbb8a235c22cb65342872635d90ad308b4c338fe",
      "translation_text_hash": "1ef4de93a4a4c48d4f5aa6312f355e7c72fa57b9de906f9c754e5d7d6388bcdb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너는 와서 내 식물을 먹으며 내 혼합한 포도주를 마시고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1ef4de93a4a4c48d4f5aa6312f355e7c72fa57b9de906f9c754e5d7d6388bcdb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PRO:9:6",
